  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p3300.html",
  "prefLabel": "He-P 3303.01 Recipient Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3303.01 Recipient Eligibility.\n\n(a) An individual who is currently receiving WIC benefits or who is on the waiting list to receive WIC benefits pursuant to He-P 3202, excluding infants younger than 6 months of age, shall be eligible to receive FMNP benefits.\n\n(b) Recipient benefits shall be provided to recipients based upon approved categories as specified in He-P 3202.03.\n\n(c) The department shall limit recipient certifications, as necessary, by imposing additional eligibility requirements in accordance with 7 CFR 248.6(b), due to funding restrictions that impact the state of New Hampshire’s ability to fund all eligible FMNP recipients.\n\n(d) In accordance with 7 CFR 248.8(b), the value of the federal FMNP benefit received by each recipient shall not be less than $10 per year and not more than $30 per year.\n\nSource. #14200, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p3300.html"
}
